# Kingpin-Tools

Windows/MSYS2/Code::Blocks-friendly source tree for Kingpin: Life of Crime tools.

This repository is focused on **Kingpin** tools, not generic Quake II tools.
It is based on work around decompiling and reconstructing tools such as `kpdata.exe` and `kpbsp.exe`.
`kpvis` appears to be effectively the same as `qvis`, so parts of the Quake II toolchain were used as a practical base where appropriate.

## Scope

This fork is intended for:
- `kpbsp`
- `kpvis`
- `kpdata`
- related Kingpin-oriented tool work

It is **not** intended as a straight Quake II tools fork, even though parts of the code and structure are closely related.
